// panel for @st0/cold/stemsplit
//
// Labels and nothing else, and that is honest rather than lazy: this module has no knob to turn. Its one
// parameter is a FILE (the model), which the builder draws from the module's assets/ on its own, and its
// outputs are files rather than a signal there is anything to meter. What the panel is for here is saying
// which four stems come out, in the order the model returns them — the order a chains file wires by name.
cols(4)
rows(1)
widgets({
  drums: { type: "label", col: 0, row: 0, label: "drums" },
  bass: { type: "label", col: 1, row: 0, label: "bass" },
  other: { type: "label", col: 2, row: 0, label: "other" },
  vocals: { type: "label", col: 3, row: 0, label: "vocals" },
})
